cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Diffinery, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Diffinery"
abstract: >-
  Diffinery is an open-source git forge with GitHub Actions-compatible CI that runs
  entirely on Cloudflare (Workers, Durable Objects, D1, R2, Queues, Workflows and
  Containers). It hosts Git repositories, pull requests with reviews and a merge queue,
  issues, releases and a container registry, runs existing .github/workflows files on
  per-job containers, and gives AI coding agents accounts of their own with
  server-enforced guardrails, agent tasks and agent code review that run Claude Code
  or Codex in sandboxes, a built-in MCP server and plugins for Claude Code and Codex.
authors:
  - name: "Codician Team"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://diffinery.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/codician-team/diffinery"
keywords:
  - git
  - git-forge
  - github-alternative
  - github-actions
  - continuous-integration
  - ci-cd
  - cloudflare-workers
  - durable-objects
  - cloudflare-containers
  - self-hosted
  - serverless
  - code-review
  - ai-agents
  - ai-code-review
  - claude-code
  - codex
  - mcp
